# What the .vsix holds: package.json, dist/ (the extension and its page, with the npm
# packages they bundle), media/, bin/ (the core, in a platform's package), README.md,
# LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt. Everything else stays out.
**
!package.json
!dist/**
!media/ognivo.svg
!media/icon.png
!bin/**
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt
